WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Ntụpọ atọ. Tupu ụtụtụ, eziokwu ga-apụta.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Mama n'onwe ya siri ya maka gị! Ofe ose
pụrụ iche!

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Kemgbe olee mgbe Mama na-esiri m nri?

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Ṅụọ ya, nwa m nwanyị. Ọ dị mma maka afọ
ime.

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.200
Ngwa ugbu a.

6
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Chere… gịnị bụ nke a?

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.500
Jizọs! Mama, gịnị ka i tinyere n'ofe a?!

8
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.500
Ọ bụ mmanụ nsọ! Mmanụ nsọ na-elu ilu
ntakịrị!

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ehn ehn! Nsogbu abịala!

10
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.200
Chineke m!

11
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Ada… nke a adịghị m mma ma ọlị.

12
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.200
Gosi m.

13
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.800
Mama, bido gị. Ọ bụ gị siri ya.

14
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.500
Ọ bụ ụbọchị ahụ ka m matara na… ofe ahụ
abụghị naanị maka m.
